<title>HONG KONG: H.K. dlr Sept M-3 rises 13.6 pct on year.</title>
<headline>H.K. dlr Sept M-3 rises 13.6 pct on year.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Hong Kong Monetary Authority gave the following money supply figures as percentage changes:</p>
<p>				   Sept '96    Aug '96    Sept '95</p>
<p> HK dollar M-3 (year-on-year)  +13.6	 +12.7	+16.5</p>
<p> HK dollar M-3 (month)	    +1.8	  +1.2	 +1.1</p>
<p>				   Sept '96    Aug '96    Sept '95</p>
<p> HK dollar M-1 (year-on-year) +12.2	   -6.4	 -1.5</p>
<p> HK dollar M-1 (month)	   +5.9	   -2.5	-11.7</p>
<p> HK dollar M-2 (year-on-year) +13.9	  +13.0	+16.7</p>
<p> HK dollar M-2 (month)	   +1.8	   +1.2	 +1.1</p>
<p>Loans to finance visible trade of Hong Kong (year-on-Year)</p>
<p>				    +5.6	   +5.0	+22.3</p>
<p>Other loans for use in Hong Kong (year-on-year)</p>
<p>				   +14.4	  +13.8	+11.5</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
